{"id":"e00951d7fc1c90e9","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer.md","title":"固定长度字码保持 PCP 解","display":"thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer — 固定长度字码保持 PCP 解","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer","aliases":["73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer"],"display":"thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer — 固定长度字码保持 PCP 解","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"Exercise 9.4.2, print p. 412; PDF p. 434; explicit fixed-length solution","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer — 固定长度字码保持 PCP 解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" href=\"?note=ef2510d5b7c48e0c\" title=\"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions\">73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Exercise 9.4.2, print p. 412; PDF p. 434; explicit fixed-length solution"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k,q\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\">\\(u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\">\\(v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\\)</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^q\">\\(e:\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat e:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\widehat e:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_e=\\langle(\\widehat e(u_i),\\widehat e(v_i)):0\\le i&lt;k\\rangle\">\\(I_e=\\langle(\\widehat e(u_i),\\widehat e(v_i)):0\\le i&lt;k\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat e(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}e(w(j))\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat e(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}e(w(j))\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\;\n[\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I_e,\\iota)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\;\n[\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I_e,\\iota)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同态保留拼接；反向将相等二进制词每 q 位切一块，由 e 单射恢复逐字相等。要求 q≥1，避免把所有原字母擦成 ε。有限字母表可有效选足够长的固定码，所以 PCP 的不可判定性可移到固定二进制字母表。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions","status":"resolved","id":"ef2510d5b7c48e0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"k,q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))","display":false},{"tex":"e:\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^q","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat e:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"I_e=\\langle(\\widehat e(u_i),\\widehat e(v_i)):0\\le i<k\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat e(w)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|w|-1}e(w(j))\\quad(w\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\;\n[\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I_e,\\iota)].","display":true}],"bytes":1683,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-binary-alphabet-transfer|固定长度字码保持 PCP 解]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["ef2510d5b7c48e0c","85832410fcdc9965"]}